WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.630
Ten trades a day – and still in the red?

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.430
Overtrading: trades driven by feelings, not setups.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.110
One: you hunt for a reason to enter.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.340
Two: three trades planned, twelve by evening.

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:21.570
Three: you keep dropping to lower timeframes.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:25.770
The antidote: a fixed daily limit.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.630
Remember: fewer trades, better trades.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:35.080
I share planned setups live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
